# Hang-On trace for segahang.cpp, on top of 0001-0004: the PLD dumps load
# optionally; each screen update logs "f FRAME MAIN SUB Z80CYC IDXHASH RGBHASH
# MINY MAXY" (ORTRACE_HASH_CLIP hashes only the rows drawn), ORTRACE_FBDUMP_DIR
# writes the frames, ORTRACE_REPLAY replays tests/replays/hangon_*.rpl
# (SERVICE, COINAGE, DSW, UNKNOWN, ADC0-3) and ORTRACE_PCS writes the seeds
# at exit. Build: make SUBTARGET=hang SOURCES=src/mame/sega/segahang.cpp
# (MAME's first screen update comes at power on, so its frame N+1 is the
# native frame N.)

diff --git a/src/mame/sega/segahang.cpp b/src/mame/sega/segahang.cpp
